<translation id="5592122595094519401">Sasisha Growser ili iendelee kutumia data ya Growser katika Akaunti yako ya Growser, <ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL"/></translation>
<translation id="2569754604093464025">Ili upate masasisho yajayo ya Growser, utahitaji kutumia toleo la Windows 10 au toleo jipya zaidi. Kompyuta hii inatumia toleo la Windows 8.</translation>
<translation id="8362914115861174987">Tafsiri kwa</translation>
